---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact Us
permalink: /contact-us/
description: "Contact Dr. Badeea Qureshi at Meaningful Psychiatry for virtual psychiatric services across Washington State."
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Virtual Psychiatric Services in Washington State</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__sub">Questions? Need to request an appointment? Book securely online, or call or text us.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/contact-section.njk" %}

{%- if site.inquiryFormEmbedUrl %}
<section class="section section--light" id="request-form">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Prefer to send us your information?</p>
      <h2>Free 15-minute consult with Dr. Qureshi</h2>
      <p class="section-head__sub">Fill out this short form and our care coordinator will reach out within one business day to set up a free 15-minute call with our lead psychiatrist, Dr. Badeea Qureshi.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="consult-steps">
      <li><span class="consult-steps__num">1</span><div><strong>Reach out</strong><p>Call or text our confidential line at <a href="{{ site.phoneLink }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>, or complete the secure form below.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="consult-steps__num">2</span><div><strong>A brief phone conversation</strong><p>Dr. Qureshi will call you back to talk through what you're looking for and whether the practice is a good fit for your needs.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="consult-steps__num">3</span><div><strong>Schedule your evaluation</strong><p>If you'd like to move forward, we'll schedule your initial evaluation.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="embed-form">
      <iframe src="{{ site.inquiryFormEmbedUrl }}" title="Free consult request form" loading="lazy">Loading the form…</iframe>
    </div>
    <p class="privacy-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span><strong>Your privacy matters.</strong> This form is hosted securely by Google Workspace under our HIPAA agreement. Please don't include detailed medical information; we'll gather your history during intake. If you're in crisis, call or text 988. For emergencies, call 911.</span></p>
    {%- if site.inquiryFormUrl %}<p class="center booking-card__help">Form not loading? <a href="{{ site.inquiryFormUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open it in a new tab</a>.</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}
{% include "partials/testimonials.njk" %}
